- we propose a novel approach to solving the light transport equation by directly optimizing Gaussians, to obtain a viewindependent solution;
- the complexity of our model adapts to the solution and is not constrained by the geometry of the scene;
- we show that this approach matches or improves on existing neural methods in quality, while training 10 – 23× faster and rendering 2 – 4× faster, with a memory footprint of just a few megabytes.
